config BR2_PACKAGE_SCARLETT4_FIRMWARE
	bool "scarlett4-firmware"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_FCP_SUPPORT
	help
	  The firmware of the Focusrite Scarlett 18i20 of the fourth
	  generation, as Focusrite publishes it for use with Linux: the
	  file fcp-tool writes into the interface when asked to update
	  it. Nothing in the image does so by itself.

	  Only the file of the 18i20 (USB 1235:821d) is installed, in
	  /usr/lib/firmware/scarlett4. It is not free software: it may
	  be passed on unchanged, for use with products of Focusrite
	  only (LICENSE.Focusrite).

	  https://github.com/geoffreybennett/scarlett4-firmware
